        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Prince\n- Groups: The Revolution\n- Works: “I Would Die 4 U”, Purple Rain, Purple Rain film\n- Topics: singles, studio albums, soundtrack album sales\n\nFacts:\n- In 1984, Prince released Purple Rain as his sixth studio album.\n- In 1984, Purple Rain was the first Prince album to feature The Revolution.\n- In 1984, Purple Rain served as the soundtrack to the film Purple Rain.\n- In 1984, “I Would Die 4 U” was released by Prince and The Revolution as the fourth US single from Purple Rain.\n- Purple Rain has sold over 25 million copies worldwide.\n- Purple Rain is the third-best-selling soundtrack album of all time.",
